  PostToolUseFailure: "fires after failed tool calls",
  SessionStart: "fires at session start and matches startup|resume|clear|compact|fork; Pi 0.82.0 startup and reload reasons map to startup, new maps to clear, and resume/fork are preserved, while compact is emitted synthetically after compaction commits. For compact-source main and child events, stdout/additionalContext is restored, ordinary exit-2/decision:block output is non-blocking, and universal continue:false terminates the committed-summary session. PARTIAL because the complete cross-scope contract is not verified",
  SessionEnd: "fires at session end",
  UserPromptSubmit: "fires on user prompt; stdout injected as context (main-conversation prompts only — panel drill-down steering bypasses it, see feature.background-agents)",
  Stop: "fires when the main agent wants to stop; exit 2 blocks stopping",
